<Institutional title="About Us" description="Discover CleanMa and our mission to empower cleaning business owners with connected technology." path="/about">
  <span class="slbl">Our story</span>
  <h1>Built for the people <span>behind every clean</span></h1>
  <p class="cma-document-lead">CleanMa brings the daily work of running a cleaning business into one clear, connected workspace.</p>
  <h2>Less administration. More room to grow.</h2>
  <p>Running a cleaning business means looking after clients, coordinating people and keeping standards high across every location. When that work is spread across spreadsheets, paper rotas and message threads, it becomes harder to see the whole picture.</p>
  <p>CleanMa is built around a simple idea: give cleaning business owners practical technology that helps them organise operations, support their crews and make informed decisions.</p>
  <h2>One platform, connected teams</h2>
  <p>From scheduling and GPS check-ins to job records and client information, our focus is helping office and field teams stay connected. Clear information gives owners more time to build relationships and develop their business.</p>
  <h2>Designed with UK operations in mind</h2>
  <p>UK postcodes, pounds sterling and the realities of managing cleaning crews shape the CleanMa experience. We aim to make day-to-day work easier to understand, easier to coordinate and easier to scale.</p>
